": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le12ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le12ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn8le12ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn8le12ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "<p>So, what can be done about the issue of violent cartoons for kids?</p>Some parents limit the amount of TV their children watch every day. Television stations show an advisory for programs that are not suitable for young children. They usually show them late at night, when most children are asleep. However, there aren't any limits on cartoons, which are usually shown in the afternoon.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn8le12ob02re2img02.jpg", "text": "Researchers in a recent study were trying to find out if \"positive\" cartoons would have a good effect on children. By \"positive\" cartoons, they meant cartoons showing characters that helped one another, shared things, and cooperated in some way.\nForty children between the ages of three and five were shown positive cartoons. After watching the cartoons, the children returned to their classroom. While they were playing freely for an hour they were watched by an observer who sat in the classroom and wrote down positive things they did.", "time": "24750", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn8le12ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "They were taking turns, sharing toys, and helping each other. The children behaved better than the other groups that had not seen the positive cartoons. To sum up, this study shows that TV can educate children to be either violent or cooperative. It is impossible to stop children watching TV. Nevertheless, it might be a good idea for TV stations to show more positive children's programs and less violent ones.", "time": "57250", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}